    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/f8ce31828613a466769e05563d1d3656.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/f8ce31828613a466769e05563d1d3656.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Formula 2D - Steer To Persevere</strong> is a top of the line Formula Racing game where mild similarities with real racing are entirely coincidental </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Create and customize your team \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Upgrade your facilities to improve your car \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Become the world champion in campaign mode \ud83c\udfc1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Compete with players worldwide in asynchronous multiplayer \ud83c\udfc6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Play Co-Op\u00a0with\u00a0up\u00a0to 8+ players \ud83c\udfae\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc66\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/c9d46c86ecf76f3bbe72e997051e2157.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Compete against player all over the world in asynchronous Races. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/31b471c97c43ab05e93e8812172027ad.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/31b471c97c43ab05e93e8812172027ad.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/31b471c97c43ab05e93e8812172027ad.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Challenge drivers from every corner of the globe in thrilling races. Submit your best lap times and see how you stack up against other racers. With every race, you'll face new opponents and ever-changing conditions. Can you consistently outpace the competition and secure your place at the top of the global leaderboards ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/9f52bf667dba0f109e773496a27e230f.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Co-op with up to 8 players </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/a8489c3849fe501de561e3c8fff1b12c.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/a8489c3849fe501de561e3c8fff1b12c.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/a8489c3849fe501de561e3c8fff1b12c.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Splitscreen, shared screen or even Steam Remote play. Have friends join your race at any time on any mode with drop in Co-op. So join forces and aim for the constructor's championship in career mode or compete with players world wide in asynchronous races ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/e73ad5972fb73bf3e2500756faed6ad3.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Participate in weekly challenges that emulate the real world championships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/0215abd08cba020843cc9a298fa94bcf.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/0215abd08cba020843cc9a298fa94bcf.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/0215abd08cba020843cc9a298fa94bcf.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Test your skills in dynamic weekly challenges inspired by real-world racing events. Each week brings new tracks, different weather conditions, and unique racing scenarios. Compete for glory, exclusive rewards, and the chance to prove that you have what it takes to be a true champion in both virtual and real racing worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/9f52bf667dba0f109e773496a27e230f.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Overtake on track or strategize your way to victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/75643fea4261e87b3efb482bfc3c50a2.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/75643fea4261e87b3efb482bfc3c50a2.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/75643fea4261e87b3efb482bfc3c50a2.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DRS, pit stops, weather changes\u2014use every tool at your disposal to outsmart and outpace your rivals. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/c9d46c86ecf76f3bbe72e997051e2157.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create your own team and upgrade your facilities </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/84250f350d2cab30a6045f22534f700d.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/84250f350d2cab30a6045f22534f700d.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/84250f350d2cab30a6045f22534f700d.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Build and manage your own racing team from the ground up. Develop your headquarters, attract top-tier sponsors, and invest in cutting-edge technology. Upgrade your car's performance, improve your team's efficiency, and turn your fledgling team into a powerhouse. Guide your team through the seasons and aim to become the world champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/e73ad5972fb73bf3e2500756faed6ad3.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Design the car you want</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/718cb728395b0c42a8ab7d2aaa9ae59f.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/718cb728395b0c42a8ab7d2aaa9ae59f.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/718cb728395b0c42a8ab7d2aaa9ae59f.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Unleash your creativity and  design your perfect race car. Customize every detail of the livery to ensure your vehicle stands out on the track. With endless customization options, you can create a car that not only looks amazing but also delivers peak performance in every race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/9f52bf667dba0f109e773496a27e230f.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb the ranks online and unlock a ton of rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/f7b492230fd814df0d35835101280924.poster.avif?t=1744213639\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/f7b492230fd814df0d35835101280924.webm?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/f7b492230fd814df0d35835101280924.mp4?t=1744213639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Rise through the online leaderboards by competing in intense, skill-based races. Prove your mettle against other players and earn a variety of exciting rewards. Unlock new cars, customizations, and exclusive content as you progress. Can you reach the top and claim the ultimate rewards?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2088330/extras/c9d46c86ecf76f3bbe72e997051e2157.webp?t=1744213639\" /></div>Enjoy all the great features that make the biggest motorsport ever</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 20+ Tracks from all over the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Weather changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Tyre strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- DRS management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- And so much more...</p>",
