    "reviews": "\u201cHigh-resolution textures, brilliant lighting effects and a realistic damage model. These are all features that Formula 2D: Steer to Persevere can't boast of. But it proves that these are not necessary at all to present a solid game. And unlike the shooting star from Codemasters and Electronic Arts, the top-down racing game is a one-person project by zyg101, where the small details make all the difference.\u201d<br>Quick-Save<br>",
